  "prefLabel": "Ed 1123.10 Parental Withdrawal of Due Process Hearing Complaint",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1123.10 Parental Withdrawal of Due Process Hearing Complaint. A parent may withdraw an administrative due process hearing complaint without prejudice until such time as the parent retains legal counsel.\n\nSource. (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1100) #9197, eff 6-28-08; ss by #12141, eff 3-24-17",
